\"If a 'Monitor Train' activity occurs and its 'Train Status' attribute is 'Delayed', then a 'Manage Delay' activity must eventually occur after the 'Monitor Train' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Monitor Train' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Manage Delay' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Monitor Train'. If 'Monitor Train' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Manage Delay'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Train' activity involves tracking the status and progress of a train during its journey.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Manage Delay\",\"description\":\"The 'Manage Delay' activity involves handling and mitigating any delays encountered by a train.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Train Status is Delayed\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Perform Maintenance' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by 'Dispatch Train' activity, with no other activities occurring in between.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Train' activity involves sending a train out on its scheduled route.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Perform Maintenance\",\"description\":\"The 'Perform Maintenance' activity involves carrying out maintenance tasks on a train.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Inspect Track' activity must be followed by an 'Allocate Resources' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, an 'Allocate Resources' event can occur only if an 'Inspect Track' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Inspect Track' impose obligations for future 'Allocate Resources', and 'Allocate Resources' cannot occur without prior 'Inspect Track'. Multiple 'Inspect Track' and 'Allocate Resources' are allowed, with each 'Inspect Track' eventually leading to an 'Allocate Resources' and each 'Allocate Resources' being justified by a preceding 'Inspect Track'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Inspect Track\",\"description\":\"The 'Inspect Track' activity involves examining the condition of railway tracks.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Allocate Resources\",\"description\":\"The 'Allocate Resources' activity involves assigning necessary resources such as tracks and equipment to a train.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Dispatch Train' activity occurs in a process instance, then 'Receive Train' activity must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Dispatch Train' event. If 'Dispatch Train' does not occur, there is no requirement for 'Receive Train' to occur. Multiple occurrences of 'Dispatch Train' are satisfied by at least one occurrence of 'Receive Train', and multiple 'Receive Train' instances are allowed.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Train' activity involves sending a train out on its scheduled route.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Receive Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Receive Train' activity involves accepting a train upon its arrival at a station.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Train' activity and the 'Cancel Train' activity cannot both occur within the same process instance. This means that if 'Dispatch Train' event occurs one or more times, 'Cancel Train' must not occur at all in that process instance, and vice-versa. It is acceptable for neither event to occur. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusion between 'Dispatch Train' and 'Cancel Train', allowing for different process variants based on which event (if any) occurs.\",\"template\":\"Not Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Train' activity involves sending a train out on its scheduled route.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Cancel Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Cancel Train' activity involves canceling a train's scheduled service.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Update Schedule' activity cannot be immediately followed by a 'Schedule Train' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, a 'Schedule Train' event cannot be immediately preceded by an 'Update Schedule' event. This constraint allows multiple occurrences of 'Update Schedule' and 'Schedule Train' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Update Schedule\",\"description\":\"The 'Update Schedule' activity involves modifying the train schedule as needed.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Schedule Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Schedule Train' activity represents the process of scheduling a train for its planned route.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"At least one of the activities 'Dispatch Train' or 'Cancel Train' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if 'Dispatch Train' event occurs, 'Cancel Train' event occurs, or both occur. There is no restriction on the order or the number of times they occur. However, if neither 'Dispatch Train' nor 'Cancel Train' occurs, the constraint is violated.\",\"template\":\"Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Train' activity involves sending a train out on its scheduled route.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Cancel Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Cancel Train' activity involves canceling a train's scheduled service.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Cancel Train' must not occur 2 times in the process.\",\"template\":\"Absence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Cancel Train\",\"description\":\"The 'Cancel Train' activity involves canceling a train's scheduled service.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":2}]}"